            "text_size": "regular",
            "text_weight": "regular",
            "text": "<p>Receive a 20-page magazine in the mail every month. Each issue also comes with a downloadable PDF Parent Guide, packed with conversation starters and article summaries.</p>",
            "custom_color": "",
            "text_b": "<p>This plan includes everything in the standard subscription, plus digital access to current and past issues. It also features bonus activities, parent-focused resources, and a 'Plus Pack' of over 20 pages that dives deeper into each month’s topic.</p>",
